  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RWI of Human Rights and    Humanitarian Aid (RWI) Southeast Asia 10-15 - RWI reg Asia 10-15</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RWI of Human Rights and    Humanitarian Aid (RWI) Sydost Asien 10-15</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional program for capacity building in human rights with two       purposes: first, to strengthen national institutions for human rights (NHR) institutional capacity to promote and protect human rights, and second, to strengthen the capacity of academic institutions in SEA to deliver high-quality educ / research in the field for MR and          participate actively in the public debate on Human rigths.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regionalt program f&#xf6;r kapacitetsutveckling inom m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter med tv&#xe5; syften; det f&#xf6;rsta att st&#xe4;rka nationella institutioner f&#xf6;r    MR(NHRI) institutionella kapaciteten att fr&#xe4;mja och skydda m&#xe4;nskliga  r&#xe4;ttigheter;och det andra att st&#xe4;rka kapaciteten hos akademiska       institutioner i SEA att leverera h&#xf6;gkvalitativ utb/ forsk inom        omr&#xe5;det f&#xf6;r MR samt delta aktivt i den offentliga MR debatt.</narrative>
  </description>
